{"unit_id": "tag:02VV:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n事实上，fpqc-覆盖（coverings）的下降（descent）数据（data）之间的拉回（pullback）函子（functor）是完全忠实的（fully faithful）。换言之，概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）满足 fpqc 下降（descent）。本节的目标是证明这一点。鼓励读者自行证明这一点。关键在于使用引理<REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["fpqc-", "fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实的"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "coverings", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "fpqc 为来源缩写，覆盖双语保留，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据与态射下降，待决。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据的数学名词，待决。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "拉回函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "拉回构造，待决。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实的", "context": "函子的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "下降的态射，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02VW:statement", "translation": "满射的（surjective）且平坦的（flat）态射（morphism）是概形（schemes）范畴（category）中的满态射（epimorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "态射性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的", "context": "态射性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所用范畴，待决。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "概形范畴，待决。"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射", "context": "范畴中的右消去性质，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02VW:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>为满射的（surjective）且平坦的（flat），并有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>，满足<MATH_0003>。由于<MATH_0004>是满射的（surjective），可见<MATH_0005>与<MATH_0006>在底层拓扑空间（topological spaces）上相同。取<MATH_0007>，并令（set）<MATH_0008>及<MATH_0009>。考虑局部环（local ring）映射（maps）<MATH_0010>。它们与平坦的（flat）局部同态（local homomorphism）<MATH_0011>复合后相等。由于平坦的（flat）局部同态（local homomorphism）是忠实平坦的（faithfully flat）（见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>），可知<MATH_0012>是单射的（injective）。因此<MATH_0013>，这蕴涵<MATH_0014>，如所欲证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "令"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦的"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "给定态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的", "context": "态射及局部同态，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "待比较的态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "底层空间，待决。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "令", "context": "来源中的赋值动词，不是集合名词；保留目录要求的双语，不批准分类。"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "点处的环，待决。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "环映射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "local homomorphism", "target_term": "局部同态", "context": "局部环间的同态，待决。"}, {"source_term"