{"unit_id": "tag:02VX:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes），位于<MATH_0003>上。设<MATH_0004>为<MATH_0005>上的态射（morphisms）。若<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>换基（base change）后成为同一态射（morphism），则得到如下交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0008>。因此，只须证明<MATH_0009>为满态射（epimorphism）。它是满射的（surjective）且平坦的（flat）态射（morphism）的换基（base change），故满射的（surjective）且平坦的（flat）（见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>与<REF_0002>）。因此，本引理由引理<REF_0003>推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "换基"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "换基"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "待比较的对象，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "待比较的态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "换基", "context": "给定态射的换基，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "原态射及换基，待决。"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "相等性的图，待决。"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射", "context": "待证消去性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "原态射及换基的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的", "context": "原态射及换基的性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}], "notes": []}
